# Exclude everything by default, then whitelist what the Dockerfile
# actually needs. This keeps the build context small and avoids
# uploading bin/ / obj/ from developer machines.
**

# Project sources referenced by the Host csproj. Whitelist the entire
# `src/` tree so adding a ProjectReference to a new lattice package
# (e.g. Orleans.Lattice.Replication[.Grpc]) doesn't require a parallel
# edit here. The `**/bin` and `**/obj` re-excludes below still strip
# build artefacts inside any whitelisted directory.
!src/**
!samples/MultiSiteManufacturing/src/**

# Never ship build outputs, IDE state, test results, or node_modules.
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/TestResults
**/node_modules

# Never ship secrets / local overrides.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/*.user
